<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS11" title="In 5 Related Work ‣ Attention as an Adaptive Filter" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.11 </span>Unrolling Optimization Algorithms and Connections to Attention</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
