<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS2" title="In Appendix B Additional Material ‣ Attention as an Adaptive Filter" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.2 </span>Approximating the Batch MLE with a Recursive Filter</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS3" title="In Appendix B Additional Material ‣ Attention as an Adaptive Filter" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.3 </span>Normal plus Rank-1 Noise Covariance</span></a></li>
