<li id="bib.bib10" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Bianchessi et al. [2025]</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Arthur S. Bianchessi, Rodrigo C. Barros, and Lucas S. Kupssinskü.

</span>
